  "instance_name": "audience_id",
  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The intended audience is individuals who hold anti-Muslim sentiments or are politically motivated to discredit Muslim politicians, particularly those who support progressive policies. The meme leverages the 9/11 attacks—a traumatic event often invoked in political discourse—to stigmatize Rep. Ilhan Omar, a Muslim woman of African descent, by falsely accusing her of forgetting the attacks. This targets communities that may be influenced by Islamophobic stereotypes, which associate Muslims with terrorism or violence. The meme is designed to provoke outrage and hostility toward her or her supporters, thereby appealing to audiences who are predisposed to anti-Muslim rhetoric and political character assassination.",
